cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "Non-Linear Number Systems: asymptotics of capacity-constrained Fibonacci partitions"
abstract: >-
  A research program on the asymptotics of R_c(N), the number of
  representations of N as sum_k d_k F_k with position-dependent digit bounds
  0 <= d_k <= F_k. Includes the capfib numerics package, exact values of
  R_c(N) for N <= 10^6, a proof that log R_c(N)/(log N)^2 tends to
  1/(4 log phi), and a Lean 4 / Mathlib formalisation of the elementary
  combinatorial layer.
type: software
authors:
